{"seq":1,"slug":"fem-soft-body","title":"有限元软体：用连续介质力学算真实弹性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/cloth-soft-body-simulation/soft-body/fem-soft-body","wordCount":1580,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"有限元软体-用连续介质力学算真实弹性\">有限元软体：用连续介质力学算真实弹性</h1><p><a href=\"../foundations/mass-spring-systems\">质点-弹簧</a>的弹簧刚度没有真实物理单位，调出来的「橡胶」只是看起来像橡胶。当你需要软体的形变真正符合材料力学——橡胶按杨氏模量回弹、肌肉有正确的体积守恒、金属被压过头会留下永久塑性形变——就得请出有限元方法（FEM）。它把软体切成一堆四面体，在每个四面体内用连续介质力学算出真实的弹性力。FEM 是影视特效（如 Houdini Vellum、Ziva）和高端游戏软体的物理基准，代价是计算重、实现门槛高。本篇是软体章里最硬核的一篇；它的隐式求解建立在<a href=\"../foundations/numerical-integration\">数值积分</a>的后向欧拉之上，与之相对的轻量方案是<a href=\"shape-matching\">形状匹配</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>FEM 的思想链条是：把连续的软体离散成四面体网格 → 在每个四面体内，由顶点位移算出<strong>形变梯度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span>（描述这块材料相对静止状态被拉伸/旋转/错切了多少）→ 由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 算出<strong>应变</strong>（strain，纯形变量，剔除旋转）→ 由本构模型（constitutive model）把应变换成<strong>应力</strong>（stress）→ 由应力积分出作用在四个顶点上的弹性力。整条链路有严格的连续介质力学根基，这正是它和经验性弹簧的本质区别。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[软体连续体] --&gt; B[四面体网格离散]&#10;  B --&gt; C[形变梯度 F&lt;br/&gt;从顶点位移算]&#10;  C --&gt; D[应变 strain&lt;br/&gt;剔除旋转的纯形变]&#10;  D --&gt; E[本构模型&lt;br/&gt;材料定律]&#10;  E --&gt; F[应力 stress]&#10;  F --&gt; G[积分成顶点弹性力]&#10;  G --&gt; H[隐式积分推进]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[线弹性: 快但大形变失真]&#10;  E --&gt; E2[共旋: 抗旋转失真]&#10;  E --&gt; E3[超弹性: 橡胶/生物组织]\">graph TD\n  A[软体连续体] --&gt; B[四面体网格离散]\n  B --&gt; C[形变梯度 F&lt;br/&gt;从顶点位移算]\n  C --&gt; D[应变 strain&lt;br/&gt;剔除旋转的纯形变]\n  D --&gt; E[本构模型&lt;br/&gt;材料定律]\n  E --&gt; F[应力 stress]\n  F --&gt; G[积分成顶点弹性力]\n  G --&gt; H[隐式积分推进]\n  E --&gt; E1[线弹性: 快但大形变失真]\n  E --&gt; E2[共旋: 抗旋转失真]\n  E --&gt; E3[超弹性: 橡胶/生物组织]</pre><p>下表对比软体的三条主流路线，定位本篇在其中的位置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>物理严谨度</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>实现难度</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FEM（本篇）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>影视特效、高端游戏肌肉/橡胶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"shape-matching\">形状匹配</a></td>\n<td>低（几何近似）</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>移动端、大量小软体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"pressure-volume\">压力体积</a></td>\n<td>中（特定形状）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>气球、轮胎等封闭薄壳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"形变梯度-fem-的核心量\">形变梯度：FEM 的核心量</h2><p>一切从形变梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 开始。一个四面体在静止状态下四个顶点位置已知，形变后的位置也已知，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是把「静止状态的微小向量」映射到「形变状态的微小向量」的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵。设静止状态的边矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{D}_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8361em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（三条棱组成），形变后为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{D}_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8361em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F} = \\mathbf{D}_s\\,\\mathbf{D}_m^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{D}_m^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0611em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在静止状态就能预计算，每帧只需算一次矩阵乘法。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 编码了这块材料的全部局部形变信息：它的奇异值就是三个主方向的拉伸比，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是体积变化比（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 被压缩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 膨胀，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 翻转——四面体被压穿了，FEM 的噩梦之一）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应变与本构模型-从形变到力\">应变与本构模型：从形变到力</h2><p>有了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，要先剔除其中的旋转分量得到纯形变，因为旋转不该产生弹性力。最简单的格林应变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{E} = \\frac{1}{2}(\\mathbf{F}^T\\mathbf{F} - \\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 天然旋转不变但是非线性。然后<strong>本构模型</strong>把应变换成应力，不同模型对应不同材料：</p>\n<p><strong>线弹性（linear elasticity）</strong>：应力正比于应变，最快，但只在小形变下对——大幅旋转时会出现臭名昭著的「鬼影膨胀」（物体绕转一圈竟然变大）。<strong>共旋线弹性（corotational）</strong>：先对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 做极分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F} = \\mathbf{R}\\mathbf{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">RS</span></span></span></span></span> 抽出旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，只对纯形变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 算线性应力，既保留线性模型的速度又消除旋转失真，是实时游戏软体的主力。<strong>超弹性（hyperelastic，如 Neo-Hookean、St. Venant-Kirchhoff）</strong>：用一个应变能密度函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi(\\mathbf{F})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 描述材料，力是能量的负梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{f} = -\\partial\\Psi/\\partial\\vec{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1719em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0688em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，能精确建模橡胶、生物组织的大形变非线性，是影视和 2025 年高端实时软体的选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[形变梯度 F] --&gt; B{选本构模型}&#10;  B --&gt;|小形变,最快| C[线弹性&lt;br/&gt;大旋转会鬼影膨胀]&#10;  B --&gt;|实时,抗旋转| D[共旋: 极分解抽旋转&lt;br/&gt;只对纯形变算力]&#10;  B --&gt;|大形变,真材质| E[超弹性 Neo-Hookean&lt;br/&gt;能量梯度成力]&#10;  C --&gt; F[顶点弹性力]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[形变梯度 F] --&gt; B{选本构模型}\n  B --&gt;|小形变,最快| C[线弹性&lt;br/&gt;大旋转会鬼影膨胀]\n  B --&gt;|实时,抗旋转| D[共旋: 极分解抽旋转&lt;br/&gt;只对纯形变算力]\n  B --&gt;|大形变,真材质| E[超弹性 Neo-Hookean&lt;br/&gt;能量梯度成力]\n  C --&gt; F[顶点弹性力]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"体积守恒与塑性-fem-的拿手好戏\">体积守恒与塑性：FEM 的拿手好戏</h2><p>FEM 相比弹簧网最有价值的两个能力都源于它操作真实的形变张量。<strong>体积守恒</strong>：通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 可以精确惩罚体积变化，让橡胶被压扁时往侧面鼓出（泊松效应），这是弹簧网很难自然做到的。泊松比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span>（接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 表示几乎不可压缩，如橡胶）是 FEM 直接暴露的物理参数。<strong>塑性（plasticity）</strong>：把总形变拆成弹性部分和塑性部分，当应变超过屈服阈值就把超出量「记入」塑性形变并更新静止形状——于是金属被折过头会留下永久弯折，泥巴被捏过会保持新形状。这类不可逆形变是 <a href=\"../../destruction-systems/simulation/deformation-soft\">破坏系统的软体形变</a> 等系统的物理基础之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"求解-为什么-fem-几乎必须隐式\">求解：为什么 FEM 几乎必须隐式</h2><p>四面体网格里弹性力高度非线性且刚度大，用<a href=\"../foundations/numerical-integration\">显式积分</a>会要求极小时间步，对实时不可行。所以 FEM 几乎总用**隐式（后向欧拉）**积分，每帧归结为解一个大型稀疏非线性系统：用牛顿法外层迭代，每步内层解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">M</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mathbf{M} - \\Delta t^2\\mathbf{K})\\Delta\\vec{v} = \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是全局刚度矩阵（由所有四面体的局部刚度组装而成）。共轭梯度（CG）是最常用的线性求解器。这也是为什么近年有大量工作（投影动力学 Projective Dynamics、IPC 等）专门研究如何在 GPU 上把这个求解做快——这是 <a href=\"../practice/gpu-cloth-simulation\">GPU 布料模拟</a> 里也会触及的前沿。隐式求解的高成本，正是轻量的<a href=\"shape-matching\">形状匹配</a>存在的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>FEM 把软体切成四面体，经「形变梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span></span></span></span></span> → 应变 → 本构模型 → 应力 → 顶点力」的连续介质力学链路算出物理真实的弹性力。</li>\n<li>形变梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{F} = \\mathbf{D}_s\\mathbf{D}_m^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0611em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是核心量，编码拉伸、旋转、体积变化；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det\\mathbf{F}&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 意味四面体被压翻。</li>\n<li>本构模型分线弹性（快、大旋转失真）、共旋（实时主力、极分解抽旋转）、超弹性（真材质、大形变）三档。</li>\n<li>FEM 独有体积守恒（泊松效应）与塑性（永久形变）能力，但弹性力刚硬非线性，几乎必须用隐式后向欧拉求解，成本高。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>隐式求解的积分基础 → <a href=\"../foundations/numerical-integration\">数值积分 显式/隐式</a></li>\n<li>不想算四面体的轻量替代 → <a href=\"shape-matching\">形状匹配</a></li>\n<li>封闭软体的另一条路 → <a href=\"pressure-volume\">压力与体积保持</a></li>\n<li>把 FEM 求解搬上 GPU → <a href=\"../practice/gpu-cloth-simulation\">GPU 布料模拟</a></li>\n<li>塑性形变在破坏系统里的应用 → <a href=\"../../destruction-systems/simulation/deformation-soft\">破坏系统 · 软体形变</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有限元软体：用连续介质力学算真实弹性","id":"有限元软体-用连续介质力学算真实弹性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"形变梯度：FEM 的核心量","id":"形变梯度-fem-的核心量"},{"level":2,"text":"应变与本构模型：从形变到力","id":"应变与本构模型-从形变到力"},{"level":2,"text":"体积守恒与塑性：FEM 的拿手好戏","id":"体积守恒与塑性-fem-的拿手好戏"},{"level":2,"text":"求解：为什么 FEM 几乎必须隐式","id":"求解-为什么-fem-几乎必须隐式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"弯曲与剪切约束：决定布料手感的两类约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/cloth-soft-body-simulation/cloth/bending-shearing"},"next":{"title":"形状匹配：几十行代码让物体软软地恢复原状","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/cloth-soft-body-simulation/soft-body/shape-matching"}}